@page "/book"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@inherits NFHotel.Web.Common.CancellableComponentBase
@using NFHotel.Web.Security

@inject BookingFlowViewModel ViewModel

@*
    The customer's booking flow: dates → a free room type → details → receipt, on one page. The guest chooses a
    type, never a room: the API picks a free room of the type when the booking is sent.

    The file is markup. All state, all validation and all service calls are in
    BookingFlowViewModel (UI-Spec section 4, B-10). Book.razor.cs contains only forwarding and the
    hand-over of the address to the viewmodel.

    The receipt stays on this page as step 4. The flow does not move on to the sign-in on /booking: that page asks for
    the email as well, and the guest who has just booked should not have to type it again. The booking answer carries
    the guest's session (MIL-018, ADR-0047 decision 2), but this page runs in a circuit, which cannot set a cookie. The
    button "Manage your booking" therefore posts a one-time ticket for the session to /my-booking/start, whose answer
    sets the guest cookie and opens the guest's own booking.

    PublicLayout is the default layout (Routes.razor), so there is no @@layout line.

    The steps cannot be skipped: the button to step 2 is disabled until the dates are
    valid, and the viewmodel checks them again at every transition (BR-C-04).

    The booking box on the front page lands here with ?checkIn=…&checkOut=…&guests=… in the
    address. Valid dates skip straight to the rooms; anything else starts at step 1 as before. The
    viewmodel reads the guests as well, and a value that is not a whole number leaves the field as it is.

    With the verification by email on (MIL-088, ADR-0052), step 4 is the inbox instead of the receipt: the last button
    asks for the booking, the API mails a link, and the room is booked only on the page of the link, /booking/verify,
    which signs the guest in and shows the receipt on /my-booking. The page asks the API which way holds when it starts.
*@

<PageTitle>Book a room — NFHotel</PageTitle>

<div class="pub-section">
    <div class="pub-wrap">
        <div class="pub-prose">
            <h1 class="title">Book a room</h1>
            <p class="pub-intro">
                Pick your dates, choose a room type and leave your details. Reception confirms your booking once
                we've seen it, usually within a few hours. You pay when you arrive, and there is no booking fee.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pub-booking stack-lg">
            <ol class="steps" aria-label="Booking steps">
                <li class="@ViewModel.StepClass(BookingFlowStep.Dates)"
                    aria-current="@ViewModel.StepAria(BookingFlowStep.Dates)">Dates</li>
                <li class="@ViewModel.StepClass(BookingFlowStep.Room)"
                    aria-current="@ViewModel.StepAria(BookingFlowStep.Room)">Room type</li>
                <li class="@ViewModel.StepClass(BookingFlowStep.Guest)"
                    aria-current="@ViewModel.StepAria(BookingFlowStep.Guest)">Your details</li>
                <li class="@ViewModel.StepClass(ViewModel.FinalStep)"
                    aria-current="@ViewModel.StepAria(ViewModel.FinalStep)">@ViewModel.FinalStepText</li>
            </ol>

            <ErrorAlert Errors="ViewModel.Errors" />

            @if (ViewModel.CurrentStep == BookingFlowStep.Dates)
            {
                <section class="card card-pad stack" aria-labelledby="step-dates">
                    <h2 class="subtitle" id="step-dates">When would you like to stay?</h2>

                    <div class="field-row">
                        <FormField Label="Check-in" For="check-in" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.CheckInError">
                            <input id="check-in"
                                   class="field-input numeric"
                                   type="date"
                                   min="@DateInput.Text(ViewModel.EarliestCheckIn)"
                                   max="@DateInput.Text(ViewModel.LatestCheckIn)"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.CheckInError)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.CheckInDate" />
                        </FormField>

                        <FormField Label="Check-out" For="check-out" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.CheckOutError"
                                   Hint="The day you leave doesn't count as a night.">
                            <input id="check-out"
                                   class="field-input numeric"
                                   type="date"
                                   min="@DateInput.Text(ViewModel.EarliestCheckOut)"
                                   max="@DateInput.Text(ViewModel.LatestCheckOut)"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.CheckOutError)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.CheckOutDate" />
                        </FormField>
                    </div>

                    <div class="field-row">
                        <FormField Label="Guests" For="guests" Hint="Shows the rooms with room enough for everyone.">
                            <select id="guests" class="field-select" disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy" @bind="ViewModel.Guests">
                                @foreach (var guests in BookingFlowViewModel.GuestOptions)
                                {
                                    <option value="@guests">@BookingFlowViewModel.DescribeGuests(guests)</option>
                                }
                            </select>
                        </FormField>
                    </div>

                    <p class="muted" role="status">@ViewModel.NightsText</p>

                    <div class="row">
                        <button type="button"
                                class="btn btn-primary"
                                disabled="@(!ViewModel.CanFindRooms)"
                                @onclick="FindRoomsAsync">
                            Find available rooms
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
            else if (ViewModel.CurrentStep == BookingFlowStep.Room)
            {
                <section class="card card-pad stack" aria-labelledby="step-room">
                    <div class="row-between">
                        <h2 class="subtitle" id="step-room">Choose a room type</h2>
                        <p class="muted numeric">@ViewModel.PeriodText &middot; @ViewModel.NightsText &middot; @ViewModel.GuestsText</p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="muted">You choose the type of room. Reception gives you the room itself when you check in.</p>

                    @if (ViewModel.IsBusy)
                    {
                        @* Placeholders in the shape of the rows, so the list does not push the page when it lands. *@
                        <LoadingSkeleton Rows="3" />
                    }
                    else if (ViewModel.AvailableRooms.Count == 0)
                    {
                        @* No free rooms is not an error — it is an answer to a question. *@
                        <EmptyState Title="No rooms are free for those dates"
                                    Description="Try a day or two either side, or shorten the stay. If your dates can't move, email help@nfhotel.com and reception will look for something.">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="BackToDates">
                                Pick other dates
                            </button>
                        </EmptyState>
                    }
                    else if (ViewModel.VisibleRoomTypes.Count == 0)
                    {
                        @* Rooms are free, but none sleeps the party. The guest decides whether to see them anyway. *@
                        <EmptyState Title="@ViewModel.NoRoomForGuestsText"
                                    Description="The free rooms are smaller. You can see them all, or book two rooms.">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="ViewModel.ShowAllRooms">
                                Show all free rooms
                            </button>
                        </EmptyState>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <ul class="pub-roomlist">
                            @foreach (var choice in ViewModel.VisibleRoomTypes)
                            {
                                <li>
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="pub-roomlist-name">@DisplayText.Describe(choice.Size)</div>
                                        <div class="pub-roomlist-desc">
                                            @BookingFlowViewModel.DescribeSleeps(choice.Sleeps)
                                            &middot; @BookingFlowViewModel.DescribeFree(choice.Free)
                                            &middot; @BookingFlowViewModel.PaymentText
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="button"
                                            class="btn btn-primary"
                                            disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                            @onclick="() => ViewModel.SelectRoomType(choice.Size)">
                                        Choose @DisplayText.Describe(choice.Size)
                                    </button>
                                </li>
                            }
                        </ul>
                    }

                    <div class="row">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy" @onclick="BackToDates">
                            Back to dates
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
            else if (ViewModel.CurrentStep == BookingFlowStep.Guest)
            {
                <section class="card card-pad stack" aria-labelledby="step-details">
                    <h2 class="subtitle" id="step-details">Your details</h2>
                    <p class="muted">@ViewModel.SelectionSummary</p>

                    <div class="field-row">
                        <FormField Label="First name" For="first-name" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.FirstName">
                            <input id="first-name"
                                   maxlength="@Guest.MaxNameLength"
                                   class="field-input"
                                   type="text"
                                   autocomplete="given-name"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.FirstName)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.FirstName" />
                        </FormField>

                        <FormField Label="Last name" For="last-name" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.LastName">
                            <input id="last-name"
                                   maxlength="@Guest.MaxNameLength"
                                   class="field-input"
                                   type="text"
                                   autocomplete="family-name"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.LastName)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.LastName" />
                        </FormField>
                    </div>

                    <div class="field-row">
                        <FormField Label="Email" For="email" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.Email"
                                   Hint="@ViewModel.EmailHint">
                            <input id="email"
                                   maxlength="@Guest.MaxEmailLength"
                                   class="field-input"
                                   type="email"
                                   autocomplete="email"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.Email)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.Email" />
                        </FormField>

                        <FormField Label="Phone" For="phone" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.PhoneNumber">
                            <input id="phone"
                                   maxlength="@Guest.MaxPhoneNumberLength"
                                   class="field-input"
                                   type="tel"
                                   autocomplete="tel"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.PhoneNumber)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.PhoneNumber" />
                        </FormField>
                    </div>

                    <div class="field-row">
                        <FormField Label="Country" For="country" IsRequired="true" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.Country">
                            <select id="country"
                                    class="field-select"
                                    autocomplete="country-name"
                                    disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                    aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.Country)"
                                    @bind="ViewModel.Country">
                                <option value="">Choose a country</option>
                                @foreach (IsoCountry country in Countries.All)
                                {
                                    <option value="@country.Name">@country.Name</option>
                                }
                            </select>
                        </FormField>

                        <FormField Label="Passport number" For="passport" Error="@ViewModel.GuestErrors.PassportNumber"
                                   Hint="Optional. It saves time at check-in.">
                            <input id="passport"
                                   maxlength="@Guest.MaxPassportNumberLength"
                                   class="field-input"
                                   type="text"
                                   disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy"
                                   aria-invalid="@Invalid(ViewModel.GuestErrors.PassportNumber)"
                                   @bind="ViewModel.PassportNumber" />
                        </FormField>
                    </div>

                    <p class="field-hint">
                        Your booking starts out as "Pending". Reception confirms it once we've seen it, usually within
                        a few hours. @BookingFlowViewModel.PaymentText.
                    </p>

                    <div class="row">
                        <button type="button"
                                class="btn btn-primary"
                                disabled="@(!ViewModel.CanSubmit)"
                                @onclick="SubmitAsync">
                            Send booking request
                        </button>

                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy" @onclick="BackToRooms">
                            Back to rooms
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
            else if (ViewModel.CurrentStep == BookingFlowStep.Inbox)
            {
                @* Nothing is booked yet: the room is booked only when the guest presses the button on the page of the link
                   (MIL-088, ADR-0052 decision 3). The page shows no reference, because there is none until then. *@
                <section class="card card-pad stack" aria-labelledby="step-inbox">
                    <h2 class="subtitle" id="step-inbox">Check your inbox</h2>

                    <AlertBox Kind="AlertKind.Ok" Message="@ViewModel.InboxText" />

                    @if (ViewModel.Notice is not null)
                    {
                        <AlertBox Kind="AlertKind.Info" Message="@ViewModel.Notice" />
                    }

                    <p>@ViewModel.LinkText</p>
                    <p class="muted">@ViewModel.SelectionSummary</p>
                    <p class="muted">
                        No email after a few minutes? Look in your spam folder, or send it again. If the email address is
                        wrong, change your details and send the request again.
                    </p>

                    <div class="row">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" disabled="@(!ViewModel.CanSendAgain)" @onclick="SendAgainAsync">
                            Send again
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy" @onclick="BackToDetails">
                            Change your details
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" disabled="@ViewModel.IsBusy" @onclick="StartOver">
                            Book another stay
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
            }
            else
            {
                <section class="stack" aria-labelledby="step-confirmation">
                    <AlertBox Kind="AlertKind.Ok"
                              Message="Thank you — we've got your booking request. Reception will confirm it shortly." />

                    <h2 class="subtitle" id="step-confirmation">Your confirmation</h2>

                    <BookingReceiptCard Receipt="ViewModel.Confirmation" />

                    <p class="muted">
                        Manage your booking now to see it, change the dates or cancel it. To come back later, open
                        <a href="@GuestSignInRegistration.SignInPath">Find your booking</a> and enter the booking
                        reference with the email you booked with.
                    </p>

                    <form method="post" action="@GuestSignInRegistration.SessionPath" class="row">
                        <AntiforgeryToken />
                        <input type="hidden" name="@GuestSignInRegistration.TicketField" value="@ViewModel.SessionTicket" />
                        @if (ViewModel.SessionTicket is not null)
                        {
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Manage your booking</button>
                        }
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" @onclick="StartOver">Book another stay</button>
                    </form>
                </section>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
